{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/829077-will-there-be-new-gamelines-made-for-cwod-rather-than-just-stuff-original-gamelines","id":829077,"title":"will there be new gamelines made for CWOD rather than just stuff original gamelines","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-02-12T19:47:44-08:00","id":829077,"title":"will there be new gamelines made for CWOD rather than just stuff original gamelines","content":"i personally think it would cool if a new version of Promethean was made for the classic world of darkness","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/962-the-viking-anarch","name":"the viking anarch","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"54"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-12T19:50:01-08:00","id":829079,"title":"","content":"Oh snap! Love me some Promethean, and it would be really awesome to do at least one gameline converted to the Classic World of Darkness, just to see what it would be like to go upstream.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-12T19:54:27-08:00","id":829082,"title":"","content":"i agree completely","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/962-the-viking-anarch","name":"the viking anarch","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"54"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-12T20:08:52-08:00","id":829084,"title":"","content":"People play oWoD because they want to be playing the same games they've enjoyed for the last twenty years; if they wanted to play something new, there's the entire rest of the tabletop roleplaying world out there, not the least of which is the CofD. oWoD doesn't have anything over any other game except for nostalgia, so there's no need for new games.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-12T20:23:22-08:00","id":829091,"title":"","content":"I mean, we can't count it out with the new edition... but the WOD is really crowded as it is.<br /> <br /> While part of its strengths, it's also a weakness in this regard. The WOD - especially with the WWP plans for the One World of Darkness - is less of a toolkit where each gameline is an optional element (even if most people play it that way). The CofD can basically add games as long as people don't feel they're too repetitious.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-12T20:43:38-08:00","id":829093,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/829077-will-there-be-new-gamelines-made-for-cwod-rather-than-just-stuff-original-gamelines?p=829091#post829091\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">especially with the WWP plans for the One World of Darkness</div> </div> </div> </div>I think this would be the key at the moment. If I were putting down money, I wouldn't bet on any big paradigm shifts for the (classic) World of Darkness anytime soon that don't hook into Paradox/White Wolf's new plans, and I would wager they're busy enough trying to kickstart the brand in the direction they want before they start adding to it. That said, never say never.<br /> <br /> For what it's worth, while I'm not a huge follower of the WoD myself, I've long thought new gamelines for it would be a fine idea and potentially pretty interesting to see.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-12T21:43:35-08:00","id":829118,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/829077-will-there-be-new-gamelines-made-for-cwod-rather-than-just-stuff-original-gamelines?p=829084#post829084\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">People play oWoD because they want to be playing the same games they've enjoyed for the last twenty years; if they wanted to play something new, there's the entire rest of the tabletop roleplaying world out there, not the least of which is the CofD. oWoD doesn't have anything over any other game except for nostalgia, so there's no need for new games.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bAs someone who likes Metaplot, and many CWoD gamelines, and finds Prometheans to be an interesting concept, but wishes the &quot;Gloom and Doom&quot; factor didn't make them almost unplayable, and who dislikes the core premise of certain CofD gamelines, (Rogue Weaver Drone, oops, I mean, Demon: the Descent) let me assure you, new gamelines added to the CWoD setting sounds very cool.<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/12.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div> &quot;A free society is one in which it is safe to be unpopular.&quot;<br /> <span style=\"color:DarkRed\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Comic Sans MS\">I find <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=web&amp;cd=3&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=0ahUKEwin4NXQzLfXAhVGySYKHV3TDXYQFgg3MAI&amp;url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.ign.com%2Farticles%2F2017%2F04%2F25%2Fmarvels-nick-spencer-on-captain-americas-betrayal-and-handling-fan-reactions&amp;usg=AOvVaw2EcsX7n5ebntygb0TizyGl\" target=\"_blank\">Nick Spencer</a> and <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=web&amp;cd=4&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=0ahUKEwiK7d7szLfXAhXCWSYKHTpKBbcQFgg4MAM&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fen.wikipedia.org%2Fwiki%2FRichard_B._Spencer&amp;usg=AOvVaw1tuP6phfINia-bh_jWsDT_\" target=\"_blank\">Richard Spencer</a> to be equally repulsive.</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6138-mangle77","name":"Mangle77","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6138_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-12T21:58:05-08:00","id":829124,"title":"","content":"i think it would be extremely cool if white wolf make some fan made game lines into official canon for example I,ve allways loved the game zombie the coil as one of my all time favorites i could almost kill for supplements for that game the net book itself can found here <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/Misc/Zombie%20the%20Coil.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pd...the%20Coil.pdf</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/962-the-viking-anarch","name":"the viking anarch","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"54"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-13T12:36:22-08:00","id":829371,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:red\">Lets not turn this into WoD vs. CofD, please.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-14T04:52:07-08:00","id":829664,"title":"","content":"The problem is about W/CoD is becoming like a &quot;Jurasic Park&quot; for hamme-film creatures. We guess is a world where are supernatural creatures are hidden and almost all humanity doesn't notice.<br /> <br /> My trick is there isn't only a Earth, but lots of parallel worlds, like a multiverse from comics of superheroes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Tell me what you brag and I will tell you what you lack&quot; (Spanish saying)<br /> <br /> \u00abThe Master Confucius said: \u201cThe noble man is in harmony but does not follow the crowd. The inferior man follows the crowd, but is not in harmony\u201d\u00bb (Anaclet 13:23)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11152-luis-carlos","name":"Luis Carlos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"258"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-14T04:57:43-08:00","id":829669,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/829077-will-there-be-new-gamelines-made-for-cwod-rather-than-just-stuff-original-gamelines?p=829084#post829084\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">People play oWoD because they want to be playing the same games they've enjoyed for the last twenty years; if they wanted to play something new, there's the entire rest of the tabletop roleplaying world out there, not the least of which is the CofD. oWoD doesn't have anything over any other game except for nostalgia, so there's no need for new games.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't think that's necessarily the case, my group just started playing oWoD 2 years ago. It has nothing to do with nostalgia.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10575-lilappleblossom","name":"lilappleblossom","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"167"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-14T08:15:43-08:00","id":829743,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Luis Carlos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/829077-will-there-be-new-gamelines-made-for-cwod-rather-than-just-stuff-original-gamelines?p=829664#post829664\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The problem is about W/CoD is becoming like a &amp;quot;Jurasic Park&amp;quot; for hamme-film creatures. We guess is a world where are supernatural creatures are hidden and almost all humanity doesn't notice.<br /> <br /> My trick is there isn't only a Earth, but lots of parallel worlds, like a multiverse from comics of superheroes.</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually they're not all that well hidden in CofD and most of Humanity does notice. They're just willfully ignorant about it. Canonnically, most humans in the Chronicles of Darkness at least know someone who has had a supernatural experience or had one themselves. They just try to tell themselves there's a perfectly rational explanation, and they don't tell other people for fear of being labeled a crazy person.<br /> <br /> I do agree in the case of WoD though, where as I understand it the supernatural is supposed to actually be a secret that most people don't know about. The more crowded the World of Darkness gets, the more it strains suspension of disbelief, especially in the Information Age. You either need to keep the number of supernatural creatures pretty limited, or put them in parallel universes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-15T07:31:09-08:00","id":830220,"title":"","content":"If anything was added to the cWoD, then that one family in the middle of Kansas who are the only remaining non-supernaturally touched people on the planet would have to comprise the entire population of the new line.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-19T23:30:33-08:00","id":833730,"title":"","content":"I wouldn't count on it anytime soon. The nostalgia appeal has something to do with it but isn't the beginning and the end. Paradox has made it clear that they eventually plan on rolling out new products/editions for all the game lines but that their core focus from the start will be Vampire/Werewolf/Mage. There's already so much material out there, and I wouldn't expect them to start churning out a new product until they've already put out something regarding secondary books like Wraith and Changeling (the new head of development has already expressed his love for Wraith, and Changeling seems to have a pretty rabid and passionate fan base).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8492-dxanders","name":"dxanders","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"378"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-20T08:24:42-08:00","id":833850,"title":"","content":"I wouldn't expect more game lines, but with the revelation that there's more third generation vampires and everyone's had their apocalypse, I would not be surprised if there were more x and y-axis splats.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-23T10:28:59-08:00","id":835869,"title":"","content":"My ST ran a Promethean game set in the oWoD* once, it was pretty awesome. I agree that it's unlikely there will be any official reverse-line-adding, but maybe there'll be a Translation Guide for doing something like this.<br /> <br /> *Changelings were Lost rather than Dreaming, but every other line was classic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5695-aceofalmonds","name":"AceOfAlmonds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5695_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"323"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-24T05:13:27-08:00","id":836355,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/829077-will-there-be-new-gamelines-made-for-cwod-rather-than-just-stuff-original-gamelines?p=830220#post830220\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If anything was added to the cWoD, then that one family in the middle of Kansas who are the only remaining non-supernaturally touched people on the planet would have to comprise the entire population of the new line.</div> </div> </div> </div>Agree. If I were them I would take the oportunity of advancing the metaplot by making a very strict culling of supernatural populations, reducing it to a 1% tops.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-24T09:20:51-08:00","id":836468,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Thorbes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/829077-will-there-be-new-gamelines-made-for-cwod-rather-than-just-stuff-original-gamelines?p=836355#post836355\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Agree. If I were them I would take the oportunity of advancing the metaplot by making a very strict culling of supernatural populations, reducing it to a 1% tops.</div> </div> </div> </div>So, Hunter: the Reckoning, basically? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-24T09:51:24-08:00","id":836493,"title":"","content":"They did say they were keeping the various Apocalypses. Presumably the numbers have been winnowed down.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}